menu "espOS SignalK"

    config ESPOS_SK_RX_FRAME_MAX
        int "Largest inbound stream frame kept (bytes)"
        default 16384
        range 2048 131072
        help
            Delta messages larger than this are dropped (logged). A
            subscription burst after reconnect (values + meta for many
            paths) can reach several KiB; raise on PSRAM boards that
            subscribe to whole families.

endmenu
